            "line-height": "120%",
            "margin-top": "6pt",
            "text-align": "justify",
            "text-indent": "22.5pt"
          },
          "table": null,
          "text": "As our founders Larry and Sergey wrote in the original founders' letter, \"Google is not a conventional company. We do not intend to become one.\" That unconventional spirit has been a driving force throughout our history, inspiring us to tackle big problems and invest in moonshots. It led us to be a pioneer in the development of artificial intelligence (AI) and, since 2016, be an AI-first company. We continue this work under the leadership of Alphabet and Google CEO, Sundar Pichai.",
          "text_hash": "0c6683ca3ecc8367796b5d5934b2864ce71d473e85fbba2b931887e8144790c8",
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
